{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]For [Fm/C]the [Gm/Bb]fruits [Ab]of [Gm]His [Ab]creation, [Cm]thanks [Eb/Bb]betoGod;
[Eb]For the [Cm]gifts to [Bb]every [Cm]na [Gm/D]tion, [D]thanks [Gm]be [Fm]to God;
[Bb]For the [Fm]plowing, [C7/E]sowing, [Ab/Eb]reaping,
[Ab/Eb]Silent [Eb7/Db]growth [Ab/C]while men are sleeping,
[Gm]Fu [G7/F]ture [Cm/Eb]needs [Ddim]in [Cm]earth’s [Eb/Bb]safe [Ab]keeping, [Eb/Bb]thanks [Cm]be [Fm/C]to [Eb]God!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]In the [Fm/C]just [Gm/Bb]reward of [Ab]labor, [Cm]God's [Eb/Bb]will [Cm]is [Ddim]done;
[Eb]In [Cm]the hop [Bb]we [Cm]give [Bb]our [Cm]neighbor, [D]God's [Gm]will [Fm]is done;
[Bb]In our [Fm]worldwide [C7/E]take [Fm]of [Ab/Eb]caring
[Ab/Eb]For [Eb7/Db]the [Ab/C]hungry and despairing,
[Gm]In [G7/F]the [Cm/Eb]harvests men [Eb/Bb]are [Ab]sharing, [Eb/Bb]God's [Cm]will [Fm/C]is [Eb]done.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Eb]For the [Fm/C]harvests [Ab]of [Gm]His [Ab]Spirit, [Cm]thanks [Eb/Bb]be [Cm]to [Ddim]God;
[Eb]For [Cm]the good [Bb]all [Cm]men [Bb]inherit, [D]thanks [Gm]be [Fm]to God;
[Bb]For the [Fm]wonders [C7/E]that [Fm]astound [Bbm/Db]us,
[Ab/Eb]For [Eb7/Db]the [Ab/C]truths [Eb/Bb]that [Ab]still confound [Gm]us,
[Gm]Most [G7/F]of [Cm/Eb]all, [Ddim]that [Cm]love [Eb/Bb]has [Ab]found us, [Eb/Bb]thanks [Cm]be [Fm/C]to [Eb]God!
{end_of_verse}
